OL,3,GNEWSAFather sets up network after
OL,4,A'dad-life got lonely'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father-of-two said he was motivated
OL,7,Fto start a new network for Peterborough
OL,8,Fdads after feeling increasingly
OL,9,Fisolated as a parent.
OL,11,FCallum Jarvis, 28, set up Dads After
OL,12,FBedtime - a social media community
OL,13,Fwhere fathers, stepfathers and
OL,14,Fgrandfathers can arrange meet-ups and
OL,15,Fhave open conversations.
OL,17,FSince its launch three weeks ago, the
OL,18,Fgroup has already grown to about 350
OL,19,Fmembers, and had one of its first "play
OL,20,Fand chats" at Ferry Meadows recently.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
